<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa Q2 current acct deficit 4.6 billion rand.</title>
<headline>S.Africa Q2 current acct deficit 4.6 billion rand.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa recorded a deficit of 4.619 billion rand on the current account of the balance of payments in the three months to June 30, the Reserve Bank said. Data in billions of rand:</p>
<p>						  Q2	Q1	 Q2 1995</p>
<p>    Merchandise exports		  23.11   20.66    19.79</p>
<p>    Net gold exports			5.21    5.31     4.83</p>
<p>    Service receipts			5.21    4.97     4.89</p>
<p>    Merchandise imports		  28.49   24.59    24.23</p>
<p>    Payments for services		 9.64    8.51     9.28</p>
<p>    Total goods and services	   -4.61   -2.17    -4.01</p>
<p>    Transfers				-0.01   -0.09     0.03</p>
<p>    Balance on current account	 -4.62   -2.26    -3.98</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
